{"page": 45, "total_pages": 1554, "total": 77652, "skills": [{"category": "design-media", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1772768371385, "description": "Generate 10 perspective/angle variations from a single image for multi-shot UGC videos.\n\n✅ USE WHEN:\n- Have a hero image and need camera angle variations\n- Creating multi-scene UGC videos (need different shots)\n- Want close-ups, wide shots, side angles from one source\n- Building a video with scene changes\n\n❌ DON'T USE WHEN:\n- Don't have a hero image yet → use morpheus-fashion-design first\n- Need completely different scenes/locations → use Morpheus multiple times\n- Just need one image → skip this step\n- Want to edit images manually → use nano-banana-pro\n\nINPUT: Single image (person with product)\nOUTPUT: 10 PNG variations with different perspectives\n\nTYPICAL PIPELINE: Morpheus → multishot-ugc → select best 4 → veed-ugc each → Remotion edit", "description_zh": "{\"answer\":\"从单张图片生成10种视角变化，用于多镜头UGC视频。\\n\\n✅ 适用场景：\\n- 有主图且需要镜头角度变化\\n- 制作多场景UGC视频（需要不同镜头）\\n- 想从单一来源获取特写、全景、侧拍\\n- 制作有场景切换的视频\\n\\n❌ 禁用场景：\\n- 尚无主图 → 先用 morpheus-fashion-design\\n- 需要完全不同的场景/地点 → 多次使用 Morpheus\\n- 仅需一张图片 → 跳过此步\\n- 想手动编辑图片 → 使用 nano-banana-pro\\n\\n输入：单张图片（人物与产品）\\n输出：10张不同视角的PNG变体\\n\\n典型流程：Morpheus → multishot-ugc → 挑选最佳4张 → 分别进行 veod-ugc → Remotion 剪辑\"}", "downloads": 1569, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/pauldelavallaz/multishot-ugc", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 184, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Multishot UGC", "ownerName": "pauldelavallaz", "score": 73362.63736263737, "slug": "multishot-ugc", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 5, "subCategories": [{"key": "design-image-gen", "name": "图片生成"}, {"key": "design-video", "name": "视频处理"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781672730342, "upstream_owner_login": "pauldelavallaz", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/pauldelavallaz/multishot-ugc", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.